        ("h3", "Step 1. Severity (S)"),
        ("p", "Read the effect and choose the effect class (E1–E9, appendix A). S follows automatically from the class. Effects that only reduce EMC filtering get E9 (regulatory non-compliance, UNECE R10), even if the function is not affected."),
        ("h3", "Step 2. Occurrence (O)"),
        ("p", "Choose O from the AIAG-VDA scale (appendix B). For a mature SMT technology with a stable process the value is usually low. Use the same reasoning for all modes and justify it in your conclusion."),
        ("h3", "Step 3. Detection at AOI, AXI and ICT"),
